E("Slow-cooker beef stew","700g braising beef; 2 onions (about 200g); 3 carrots (about 300g); 500g potatoes; 500ml beef stock; 2 tbsp tomato purée; 1 tsp dried thyme; 2 tbsp plain flour","Toss beef in flour and brown if desired. Add everything to the cooker, stir and cook until beef and vegetables are tender. Season and serve with bread or mash.","https://www.bbcgoodfood.com/recipes/slow-cooker-beef-stew","7–8 hours on LOW","20 minutes"),
