E("Slow cooker chilli con carne","500g beef mince; 1 onion (150g); 1 pepper (150g); 2 garlic cloves; 400g chopped tomatoes; 400g drained kidney beans; 150ml beef stock; 2 tsp chilli powder; 2 tsp ground cumin","Brown mince, breaking it up. Add all ingredients to the cooker and stir. Cook until mince is fully cooked and flavours meld. Serve with rice.","https://www.bbcgoodfood.com/recipes/slow-cooker-chilli-con-carne","6–8 hours on LOW","20 minutes"),
