E("Slow-cooker beef stew with dumplings","600g stewing beef; 1 onion (150g); 3 carrots (300g); 2 potatoes (about 300g); 500ml beef stock; 2 tbsp tomato purée; 150g self-raising flour; 75g suet; 6–8 tbsp cold water for dumplings","Cook beef, vegetables, stock and tomato purée until tender. Mix flour and suet with cold water to make a soft dough; form dumplings and cook on top on HIGH for 45–60 minutes until done.","https://www.bbcgoodfood.com/recipes/slow-cooker-beef-stew-with-dumplings","7–8 hours on LOW","25 minutes"),
