E("Slow cooker beef tacos","800g beef chuck; 1 onion (150g); 2 garlic cloves; 200ml beef stock; 2 tbsp tomato purée; 2 tsp smoked paprika; 2 tsp ground cumin; 8 small tortillas","Mix stock, purée and spices. Put onion and beef in cooker and pour sauce over. Cook until beef shreds easily, shred into juices and serve in tortillas.","https://www.bbcgoodfood.com/recipes/collection/slow-cooker-recipes","8 hours on LOW"),
